      "mergedPostDetails": "On the Open Beta build, it seems like the detection for when the mic is muted in-game is flipped for the \"Voice\" parameter. This does not seem to affect what remote players see, and I have had no issues that I know of for other parameters.\n\nScreenshot 1: Intended facial expression when no mic input is detected\n\nScreenshot 2: Intended facial expression when mic input is detected (to ensure blendshapes don't multiply each other and warp the face)\n\nVideo: Demonstration of both unmuted and muted behaviour. Note how wide the mouth opens on the unmuted demonstration.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Voice parameter not working as intended on open beta",
